SODA ground-station catalog
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Used in: src/app/data/catalogs/sensors/ground-stations.ts
Source:  https://github.com/messy-snail/SODA (commit fceecc9eb34756c34be5cebcff865b23a2bd869e)

Ground station coordinates adapted from SODA (MIT, (c) messy-snail), originally from
Wikidata; see per-station source links. Each station keeps its own source URL and retrieval
date, shown in the Sensor Info menu. Wikidata structured data is available under CC0.

